{"id":"steam-1418780","steam":1418780,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Nestphalia 1401","summary":"A Tower Defense/Real Time Strategy hybrid.\r\nIn the year 1401, bug kingdoms do battle from massive fortresses. Can you topple them all?","about":"Nestphalia 1401 is a Tower Defense/Real Time Strategy hybrid about careful planning and precise tactics. Take as much time as you need in the Fort Editor to design your perfect fortress, then command it's troops in battle with careful application of Tactics. Unlike other RTS games, rapid inputs are far less effective than carefully measured action.\n\nIn the campaign, you'll become an outsider to Nestphalia. You are determined to reach the capitol and solve the mystery behind the disappearance of your friends, and you'll make new friends (and enemies) along the way.\n\nKey Features:\n\n• \n30 level campaign with a plot that will keep you infested invested.\n• \nexport and share forts. Challenge your friends, or join one of our community tournaments!\n• \ncustom game engine designed from the ground up for modding support.\n\nNestphalia is waiting, make your mark!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418780/63f16dc441ffaea1948f954afef48bbe3670ed06/library_capsule.jpg?t=1761964832","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418780/79f18e6ec9483c0cceb0ef945fc8aa95a2dce924/header.jpg?t=1761964832","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418780/2f764ee0809a8299b152fa6417766d0d227cbb34/library_hero.jpg?t=1761964832","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418780/79f18e6ec9483c0cceb0ef945fc8aa95a2dce924/header.jpg?t=1761964832","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418780/71dd4c933bc447790209e433eb587a007c64ff35/ss_71dd4c933bc447790209e433eb587a007c64ff35.600x338.jpg?t=1761964832","full":"https://shared